<h2>Chat usage is at <%= @report[:percent_used] %>% of the plan limit</h2>

<p><strong><%= @report[:total] %></strong> of <strong><%= @report[:limit] %></strong> monthly active chat users
  for <%= @report[:period].begin.strftime("%B %Y") %>.</p>

<h3>By community</h3>
<ul>
  <% @report[:by_community].each do |slug, count| %>
    <li><%= slug %>: <%= count %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>To reduce usage you can turn chat off for a community:</p>
<pre>bin/rails communities:set_flag SLUG=&lt;slug&gt; FLAG=chat_enabled VALUE=false</pre>

<p>Or suspend one entirely:</p>
<pre>bin/rails communities:suspend SLUG=&lt;slug&gt; CONFIRM=true</pre>
